{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "story_tuye_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_tuye_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "沙漠之虹",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_tuye_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "3f82c12b605c2408942415978612082680b349e38ba593c1b7f1be0645f5c792",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "（揉眼睛）怎么了？发生什么了......车怎么突然停了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤干员",
      "text": "图耶小姐你醒了，不好意思，前面突然跑来一个抱着孩子的女人，我只能急刹车。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "你没撞到他们？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤干员",
      "text": "没有，刹车很及时，不过她手里拿的好像是......一个碗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰头土脸的女人",
      "text": "小姑娘，水......咳咳咳，我的孩子已经两天没有喝水了，你可怜可怜我，给我一点水吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "女士，要水喝就要水喝，带着孩子拦疾驰而过的车就不怕被卷到车轮底下吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰头土脸的女人",
      "text": "小姑娘，你们发发善心，我们也是实在没办法了，就给几口水喝吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤干员",
      "text": "图耶小姐，你看那孩子，嘴唇干裂......看着快要渴死了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "喂，女士，这几袋水你拿去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤干员",
      "text": "给这、这么多吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "剩下的你够喝就行，我可以只在必要时饮水。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤干员",
      "text": "这怎么能行！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "好了，都说了没关系了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "我记得这附近有个小镇，你们是从那儿来的吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰头土脸的女人",
      "text": "嗯，没错。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "发生什么了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰头土脸的女人",
      "text": "连续两年旱灾，镇子里没下过一滴雨。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "镇子里的井呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰头土脸的女人",
      "text": "都干涸了，从井里提上来的只有黄黄的沙子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤干员",
      "text": "......这么严重的灾情，本地的长官就没有什么作为吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰头土脸的女人",
      "text": "他不像别人一样收拾东西跑路就不错了，还能指望他做什么呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "如果都这样了，换个地方过，又会差到哪里去呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰头土脸的女人",
      "text": "故土难离......不是说说而已，未成家的年轻人说走也就走了，像我这样拖家带口的女人能去哪里？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "对不起......是我失言了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰头土脸的女人",
      "text": "哈哈，没关系。说不定熬到明年就下雨了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "明年就一定会有雨吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰头土脸的女人",
      "text": "雨总会来的，或迟或早。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "或迟或早，及时就好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰头土脸的女人",
      "text": "哈，人生得不逢时，又怎能奢求雨来得及时呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "纳吉尔，我们和本舰预定好的汇合日期是在哪一天？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤干员",
      "text": "还早，至少还有一个月，任务是提前做完的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "我们在这里能留多长时间？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤干员",
      "text": "最多半个月。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "嗯，够了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "（跳下车）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "女士，你们的镇子是在哪个方向，带路吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤干员",
      "text": "图耶小姐，你这是去干什么？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "打井！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤干员",
      "text": "什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我说，\n我要去打一口井！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤干员",
      "text": "一路走来，镇子里到处破败不堪，没想到这镇长的府邸修得倒是气派。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "你想不到吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤干员",
      "text": "这......倒也是，一处见不到花销，那必然花到另一处了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "哼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤干员",
      "text": "图耶小姐，小心！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怒气冲冲的老人",
      "text": "小丫头，你不长眼睛吗？这下可怎么办，水洒了一地，我的家里人都等着喝水呢！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤干员",
      "text": "对不起，对不起，图耶小姐不是故意的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "好了，老人家，别发脾气了，这袋水赔给你成吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怒气冲冲的老人",
      "text": "这......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "收下吧，是我走路没看路。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怒气冲冲的老人",
      "text": "异乡人，你真的要把它赔给我吗？要是拿去镇子上叫卖，至少能换七个金币。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "七个金币？你在开玩笑吗？恐怕加上这个水袋也值不了七个金币。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怒气冲冲的老人",
      "text": "光是换这坛浑水，就花了我五个金币，你这袋水这样清澈，价格肯定更高。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "（蹲下身查看坛子碎片中的残水）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "这样脏的水也是可以饮用的吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怒气冲冲的老人",
      "text": "小丫头，你觉得我们还有别的选择吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇长秘书",
      "text": "图耶小姐，久等了，镇长先生请您进来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怒气冲冲的老人",
      "text": "哈，你来找那家伙吗？那我只能祝你好运了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤干员",
      "text": "这话什么意思啊，老夫人？喂！老夫人！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "好了，纳吉尔，别喊了，早走远了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇长",
      "text": "图耶小姐，您好，我是本镇的镇长，代表镇民欢迎您的到来，哈哈。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "您好，握手就不必了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇长",
      "text": "哈哈，图耶小姐真是个性十足啊。贾米尔，还不给尊贵的客人把水端上来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇长秘书",
      "text": "图耶小姐，纳吉尔先生，请用。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "（面不改色喝下一大口）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤干员",
      "text": "（图耶小姐，这水真的可以喝吗？跟那坛水一样，都是又浑又黄。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇长",
      "text": "二位请不要因为杯子里的水浑浊不堪就觉得我们待客不周，实不相瞒，这是镇子里唯一打得出水的井了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "既然还有水喝，为什么你的镇民会冒着生命危险在荒地上向过路的车队讨水喝？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇长",
      "text": "这口水井是我祖父早年间花费重金在后院打的私井，一直以来都是家族专用的取水处，平常也没有和旁人分享过。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "这可不是平常的时候。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇长",
      "text": "是，我作为一镇之长，情势危急的时候自然不能只顾自己，去年我就把这口井开放给镇民使用了，不过......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇长",
      "text": "咳，井水有限，越用越少，自然......是价高者得。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "价格高到一坛浑水五个金币吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇长",
      "text": "（捻死桌子上的一只飞虫）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇长",
      "text": "啧，这里可是沙漠，有什么东西能比水更珍贵呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤干员",
      "text": "（这吃相真是难看。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇长",
      "text": "我听秘书报告，说二位前来本镇的目的只是打一口水井？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤干员",
      "text": "嗯，动土和打井都不是小事，所以我们特地前来拜访此地长官。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇长",
      "text": "这虽然是造福本镇的大好事，二位愿意为本镇尽心尽力，我作为镇长自然无比感激，但是，很遗憾，我不能给你们打井的许可。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤干员",
      "text": "为什么？你都说了这是好事！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇长",
      "text": "那首《偷月亮的女人》，你们听过吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "萨尔贡的每一个人都听过。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇长",
      "text": "这个镇子的历史可以追溯到一百年前，一位探险家来到这里建立了它。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇长",
      "text": "在他的手札中曾记录，那颗大如星斗的宝石就埋藏在我们的脚下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇长",
      "text": "虽说传言不可考，但是作为镇长，守护那颗宝石不受异乡人的染指是我们代代相传的使命。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇长",
      "text": "尤其呢，是那些一来就要在我们的土地上大行挖掘之事的异乡人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "我以为只有傻瓜才会相信这样的故事是真实的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇长",
      "text": "相信和真实有关系吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "你——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "纳吉尔，我们走吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤干员",
      "text": "图耶小姐等等我，别走那么快。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "呕——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤干员",
      "text": "图耶小姐，你、你还好吗？！是刚刚的水有问题？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "......嗯，如果井水变浑黄，多是因为里面铁锰含量超标，但是......\n呜，呕——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤干员",
      "text": "图耶小姐！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "......我没事。但是刚刚的水喝不出任何的铁腥味。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤干员",
      "text": "难道？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "水里的杂质......是被掺进去的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤干员",
      "text": "*萨尔贡粗口*，那你也没必要真的去喝啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "没办法，那口井一定被看得很死，我只能用这种方法证实我的猜想。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤干员",
      "text": "那现在我们要怎么办？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "先找到可以打井的泉眼再说吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "纳吉尔，你体力不够啊，我们才走了不到半天。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤干员",
      "text": "呼......呼，是不到半天，可是、可是沙地里走路实在是太费力气了，一脚深一脚浅。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "我忘了你和我不一样......你要喝水吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤干员",
      "text": "没事，让我歇歇就行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "你过来，我们再坚持走一段，到了前面的岩石后面再休息，太阳直射下，你体内的水分会很快流失。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤干员",
      "text": "可......你不是不喜欢和别人同打一把伞吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "别废话，快过来，你难道想继续晒着吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤干员",
      "text": "哦......好，没问题！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤干员",
      "text": "还是算了吧，图耶小姐你看起来不是很舒服。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "快来，有什么事过去再说。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤干员",
      "text": "咕咚咕咚——差点没渴死我。图耶小姐，走了这么长时间，你不坐下来休息一会儿吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "这个地方三面环山，是撮箕口，有利于地下水储水，而且有荫蔽，打了井更容易储水。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤干员",
      "text": "你会的东西也太多了，这些关于打井的知识，你都是在哪里学到的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "家族培养的，我们家的每一个人都会接受在沙漠中生存的训练，寻找水资源是必修的课程。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤干员",
      "text": "这是什么家族啊，怎么人人都要学这些......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "在沙漠中辗转谋生的商旅世家。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤干员",
      "text": "啊，是那个由丰蹄家族掌控的贸易公司......我早该想到的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "别讲得那么夸张，我父母这一支已经在家族血脉的边缘了，没想到那么远了，还是逃不过那些老头子的家规。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤干员",
      "text": "哈哈，多学些东西总不是坏事，保不准哪一天就派上用场了，不是吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "啊，找到了......喂，纳吉尔，接好了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤干员",
      "text": "啊！这是什么东西！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "哈哈，怕什么，它又不咬人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤干员",
      "text": "因为它长得实在是......太丑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "你可别看这虫子长得丑，没有它的帮助，我们族人早就黄沙没过头顶了。这里有它在，说明我们离泉眼不远了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "纳吉尔，帮我一个忙，翻翻这些石头，看看底下有没有长着一些灰黄色的草，叶子很细很小。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤干员",
      "text": "嗯，让我找找。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤干员",
      "text": "我找到了！还真的有啊......然后呢，图耶小姐？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "让我来看看，它的根......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "它北边的根系更发达，我们去那里看看。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤干员",
      "text": "我还以为这里除了我们没有人来的，怎么全被高高低低的木桩围起来了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "应该是一片墓地，那不是木桩，是墓碑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤干员",
      "text": "......确实，细看下来这些木桩上都刻着字。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤干员",
      "text": "“这里埋葬着慈爱的父亲，忠诚的丈夫和勇敢的战士——布里斯·萨伊丁·努曼哈德”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤干员",
      "text": "“......可爱的女儿......丽琪亚·努曼哈德”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤干员",
      "text": "“智慧的老者......引路人......穆塔里·努曼哈德”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤干员",
      "text": "看来这里埋葬的是一个姓努曼哈德的家族。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "努曼哈德......怎么看起来这么眼熟？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤干员",
      "text": "你这么一说我也觉得，好像在哪里见过。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "......啧，我想起来了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "那个混蛋镇长府邸里有一张家族挂毯，那上面的姓氏正是努曼哈德。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤干员",
      "text": "（倒吸一口气）那岂不是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "没错，我们要找的泉眼就在那个家伙祖先的埋骨之地。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤干员",
      "text": "*萨尔贡粗口*",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤干员",
      "text": "我还想，实在不行就在这里强行打一口井，那混球能拿我们怎么样？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤干员",
      "text": "现在看来......是我想得太简单了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "（双手抓紧额前的头发）别看我，我也没什么好办法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤干员",
      "text": "要不然......要不然就算了吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "......不行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤干员",
      "text": "唉......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰头土脸的女人",
      "text": "图耶小姐，图耶小姐，你还记得我吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "嗯，记得，女士，你还需要水吗？我这里还有，一会儿拿给你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰头土脸的女人",
      "text": "（摇头）不是，我是来还你水袋的，谢谢你当时的慷慨。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "......没事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰头土脸的女人",
      "text": "看你们这满面愁容的样子，打井的事情想必很不顺利吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "（不情愿地点头）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰头土脸的女人",
      "text": "回去吧，图耶小姐，离开这里吧，有那个人在，你们什么都做不了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰头土脸的女人",
      "text": "不信你们去看那面墙上贴的东西。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "这人头攒动的，啥也看不到啊。\n大家麻烦让一让，让我过去下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤干员",
      "text": "“重申......本镇严禁未经允许私自打井，参与动工者鞭二十，从井中取水者鞭十。”这个杀千刀的畜生他怎么敢！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "我简直想撬开他的胸膛看看里面到底装了些什么。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤干员",
      "text": "我猜里面独独找不到一颗良心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰头土脸的女人",
      "text": "那个人在这个地方横征暴敛，就是为了早日攒够一笔钱献给王酋，好从这里调离。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰头土脸的女人",
      "text": "他汲汲营营半辈子，怎么会放任别人挡了他的财路与仕途。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰头土脸的女人",
      "text": "你们不是这里的人，他拿你们没办法，可生活在这里的人，哪一个不是受他挟制呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "（咬牙切齿）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰头土脸的女人",
      "text": "我先回去了，图耶小姐，你也早点休息吧，太阳就快要落山了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "你的孩子，她怎么样了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰头土脸的女人",
      "text": "啊......我把她和祖母埋在一起了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "什么？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰头土脸的女人",
      "text": "你说的对，还是及时最重要。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤干员",
      "text": "图耶小姐，你还好吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "（捏捏自己的眉头）纳吉尔，我们别无选择了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "（摘下自己脖子上挂的吊坠）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "纳吉尔，这块石头给你，帮我办一件事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤干员",
      "text": "不不，图耶小姐，我不需要你给我报酬的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "不是报酬，我需要你帮我把它埋在我们昨天去的地方，记得去掉挂绳和银圈， 再在上面凿出一些痕迹。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤干员",
      "text": "这颗宝石价格昂贵，图耶小姐你这是做什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "贪得无厌之人终将自掘坟墓。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤干员",
      "text": "我们为什么要一早就等在这里，图耶小姐？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "看戏不迟到是最基本的礼貌。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "他们登场了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇长",
      "text": "你确定你没听错吗？那女人找到宝石的地点真的是在这里？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇长秘书",
      "text": "我再三确认过了，先生，没错，就在这里，那女人正是在这里避风时看到的，这颗宝石就被埋在沙地中露出一角。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇长",
      "text": "那可是罕见的东西啊，看来那首诗说的没错，这里的地下真的埋藏着值钱货。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇长秘书",
      "text": "星斗大的宝石啊，要是献给王酋，您肯定能进禄加官。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇长",
      "text": "你铲子带了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇长秘书",
      "text": "带了带了，不过先生，我们为什么不多叫几个人，我们两个人要挖到什么时候去啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇长",
      "text": "混账，这种刨自己祖坟的事情说出去我的脸面还要不要了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇长秘书",
      "text": "对对对，还是越少人知道越好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇长",
      "text": "还不快动手！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇长秘书",
      "text": "我来吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇长",
      "text": "不然呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇长秘书",
      "text": "哎，好好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇长",
      "text": "请原谅我，父亲母亲，我会感激你们的庇佑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇长",
      "text": "请原谅我，祖父祖母，我会感激你们的庇佑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇长秘书",
      "text": "咳咳咳，这扬起来的沙尘怎么是白的，呸呸。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇长",
      "text": "你有挖到什么吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇长秘书",
      "text": "没有啊，这大坑小坑的，里面没一个有东西的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇长",
      "text": "废物，滚开，让我来，我就不信邪了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇长",
      "text": "（狠狠一铲子杵下去。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "起先，只是一股混杂气泡的泥浆，从铲尖下的沙土中涌出。\n很快，更多积蓄在地下的泉水冲破了地表，在沙地上开出一朵又一朵水花，边缘泛着白沫，浸润了沙粒。\n镇长脚下的沙土开始不断下陷，秘书感觉不妙，迅速推开还未回过神的镇长。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "瞬间，汹涌的泉水喷薄而出，一道水柱笔直射向高处，冲垮了整片墓园。\n几米高的水帘将水珠洒回地面，凝聚成一条清澈的溪流，越过沙丘，流向远处的小镇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇长",
      "text": "怎么会这样......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇长",
      "text": "水，怎么只有水！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇长",
      "text": "东西呢？！宝石呢？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇长",
      "text": "我不信，你，你去接着挖！快去！给我挖！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇长秘书",
      "text": "镇长，去不得啊，去了是要被淹死的啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇长",
      "text": "那是什么声音？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "是镇民的欢呼声。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇长",
      "text": "你说什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "也是，难怪你要问，他们的声音是传不到你的耳朵里的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇长",
      "text": "（惊疑地打量着图耶）你来做什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "来恭喜你，镇长先生，要知道，沙漠中可没有什么宝藏比水更珍贵了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇长",
      "text": "（狼狈地抹去脸上的水）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "得偿所愿，您一定很满意。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇长",
      "text": "你，是你——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "（耸肩）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇长",
      "text": "你敢打我！是不是那些穷鬼让你来的！是不是！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇长",
      "text": "我不会放过他们的！有一个算一个，谁也别想好过！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "看你这气急败坏的样子，经年累月做一个梦，一夕支离破碎，滋味好不好呀？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "不如我来给你指条明路吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "不惜毁坏祖先的坟墓，也要为镇民取水，传出去也是大功一件，上报给王酋，镇长先生，你想调到哪里都不是问题啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "不过啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "不过就算你去再富庶的地方，混得再有头脸，终其一生，也就是一只吸血的臭虫！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "我为你发了一封请功的信件，不到一个月，王酋的使节应该就要来了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "如果你还想离开这里，我劝你抓住机会，善待这里的镇民，想个办法好好立些贤名吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "这是你最后的机会了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇长",
      "text": "你......你......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "好秘书，还不扶你的镇长离开，你看他一句话都说不出来了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "走吧，纳吉尔，我们要做的事情已经结束了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤干员",
      "text": "图耶小姐......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "图耶",
      "text": "纳吉尔？你怎么还不跟上来？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外勤干员",
      "text": "图耶小姐，你看彩虹，阳光下有一片彩虹出现了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
